{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../schema/biome.schema.json",
  "realm": "end",
  "inspiredBy": "BetterEnd's umbrella jungle.",
  "differs": "A jungle in the End, where vanilla's islands are bare: tall thin purpur stalks crowded together, each under a drooping dome of purple and magenta stained glass, end rods hanging point-down from the cap rims and undersides, moss patches and carpets on the end stone between them, and purple motes and a purple glow in the air.",
